 "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >从荒地到天堂</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >和你的<strong>兄弟们</strong>一起穿越风景如画的荒地。普通的路已经没了——自己开辟一条吧。   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4410360/extras/6836c18df06fefa30a946e7992620a9c.poster.avif?t=1789835697\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4410360/extras/6836c18df06fefa30a946e7992620a9c.webm?t=1789835697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4410360/extras/6836c18df06fefa30a946e7992620a9c.mp4?t=1789835697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >车轮上的家</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >你的巴士就是你的庇护所、你的交通工具,也是你最后的防线。一旦失去它,你就得徒步穿越地狱。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >朋友会变</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >饿太久,你就会盯上队友。被僵尸咬一口或者被辐射击中,你自己也会变成那玩意儿。开始的队伍,不会是你最后剩下的队伍。  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4410360/extras/6649ffc8aeb16d52e462962add48b8b7.poster.avif?t=1789835697\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4410360/extras/6649ffc8aeb16d52e462962add48b8b7.webm?t=1789835697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4410360/extras/6649ffc8aeb16d52e462962add48b8b7.mp4?t=1789835697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >磁力炮</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >用独特的磁力炮把你的巴士抬起、翻转、扔到任何地方。只是别把它砸坏了——那是你唯一的家。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4410360/extras/3418240581f77c4b86dac8ebef12c965.poster.avif?t=1789835697\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4410360/extras/3418240581f77c4b86dac8ebef12c965.webm?t=1789835697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4410360/extras/3418240581f77c4b86dac8ebef12c965.mp4?t=1789835697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >废料炮</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >你的巴士是带武器的。你装什么进去,它就发射什么——瓶子、罐头、废料。瞄准僵尸。或者队友。<br>  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4410360/extras/f07d2e57e29ea322c2771d1275814a7e.poster.avif?t=1789835697\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4410360/extras/f07d2e57e29ea322c2771d1275814a7e.webm?t=1789835697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4410360/extras/f07d2e57e29ea322c2771d1275814a7e.mp4?t=1789835697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >死亡不是终点</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >等待重生太难受。不如变成幽灵、僵尸或一个软趴趴的布娃娃。带着独特的加成和限制继续玩,直到一只 Hell-Kitty 帮你恢复人形。  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >废品场天堂</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >瓶子、罐头、废料——你找到的任何东西都能变成废料炮的弹药。捡到电池?用它来修补巴士。 </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >特色:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 人合作巴士管理</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>车顶安装的废料炮</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>磁力炮:抬起、翻转、扔出巴士</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>用废料在公路上搭建桥梁</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>可玩状态:幽灵 / 僵尸 / 布娃娃 / 饥饿</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>语音聊天和在线合作</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>冰镇 Atomic Cola 和 Green Burger</strong></p></li></ul>",
 "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >从荒地到天堂</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >和你的<strong>兄弟们</strong>一起穿越风景如画的荒地。普通的路已经没了——自己开辟一条吧。   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4410360/extras/6836c18df06fefa30a946e7992620a9c.poster.avif?t=1789835697\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4410360/extras/6836c18df06fefa30a946e7992620a9c.webm?t=1789835697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4410360/extras/6836c18df06fefa30a946e7992620a9c.mp4?t=1789835697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >车轮上的家</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >你的巴士就是你的庇护所、你的交通工具,也是你最后的防线。一旦失去它,你就得徒步穿越地狱。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >朋友会变</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >饿太久,你就会盯上队友。被僵尸咬一口或者被辐射击中,你自己也会变成那玩意儿。开始的队伍,不会是你最后剩下的队伍。  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4410360/extras/6649ffc8aeb16d52e462962add48b8b7.poster.avif?t=1789835697\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4410360/extras/6649ffc8aeb16d52e462962add48b8b7.webm?t=1789835697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4410360/extras/6649ffc8aeb16d52e462962add48b8b7.mp4?t=1789835697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >磁力炮</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >用独特的磁力炮把你的巴士抬起、翻转、扔到任何地方。只是别把它砸坏了——那是你唯一的家。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4410360/extras/3418240581f77c4b86dac8ebef12c965.poster.avif?t=1789835697\" width=1170 height=